      "writtenOn": "2023-09-27T10:10:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for bringing up this point. Indeed, when `Digester` was an enum, all the supported algorithms are pulled in. But after I changed `Digester` to struct, we only pull in the `EVP_sha512` as before this cl.\n\nOtherwise, this cl makes pvmfw_bin grow from 497792 bytes to 497952 bytes.\n\nCan you take another look?",
      "parentUuid": "37aa3f7e_682980fe",
